<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Mathomo in talks, cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>Mathomo in talks, cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Mathomo Ltd said on Wednesday that it was still in ongoing talks that could have an effect on its share price.</p>
<p>The firm warned shareholders to exercise caution when dealing in its stock until a further announcement is made.</p>
<p>The firm gave no other details in a brief statement.</p>
